=== PropertyInitializers Sample ===
--- Constructor args + initializer ---
  Point: Point(X=3, Y=4)
--- No constructor args + initializer ---
  Config: Config(Timeout=30, Verbose=True, Name=)
--- Empty initializer block ---
  Empty: Config(Timeout=0, Verbose=False, Name=)
--- Init-only properties ---
  Record: Record(Id=abc-123, Version=5, Tag=release)
--- Set properties ---
  Config: Config(Timeout=60, Verbose=False, Name=production)
--- Multiple properties ---
  Config: Config(Timeout=30, Verbose=True, Name=test)
--- As method argument ---
  ProcessConfig: Config(Timeout=0, Verbose=True, Name=arg-demo)
--- Variable declaration with var ---
  var c: Config(Timeout=10, Verbose=False, Name=)
--- Generic type ---
  Box<int>: Box(Value=42, Tag=integer)
  Box<string>: Box(Value=hello, Tag=text)
--- Struct type ---
  MyStruct: MyStruct(X=1, Y=2)
--- Public field ---
  Data: Data(Count=7, Label=items)
--- Complex expressions ---
  Data: Data(Count=11, Label=item-42)
--- Mixed init/set properties ---
  MixedProps: MixedProps(ReadOnlyName=immutable, MutableCount=99)
Done!
